      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bit of an extended note on this one - we weren't able to reproduce this issue at all internally, and see no reason it should occur. That said, with the next 2024.3.3 update (build 1512 or higher) we included a workaround that simply doesn't launch `install.exe` if the active VRChat directory is already registered as the active one. That way it should also not be possible for it to get stuck.\n\nIf you have any additional info that you think would help resolve this, or if this workaround does not work for you at all, please let us know here and we can revisit!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
