  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-12-17T04:03:54.792Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Upon closing the game, the OSC service ceases to function correctly. This appears to be linked to a failure in the proper closure of the \"install.exe\" process, which is initiated by the game upon closing. \"Install.exe\" will remain suspended in the background eating the port that OSC uses and making that port unusable for OSC actions until you either close the \"install.exe\" process manually or restart windows to free it which breaks all OSC applications. this issue has been observed to be common with myself and multiple of my friends.",
